      "limitations": ["programme-related respondent frame", "mixed public/private sample", "invitation-frame denominator not reported", "not specific to AI4WORK eligible adults"],
      "use": "Direct organizational perception evidence for Centru. It materially reduces the employer-evidence gap in Centru but does not substitute a three-region employer sample."
    },
    {
