        {"name":"tertiary_education_vs_cloud_use_association","measure_type":"correlation","value":0.478,"unit":"Pearson R","significance":"p<0.001"}
      ],
      "use": "Mechanism/triangulation evidence: regions with more skilled working-age populations show higher firm digital adoption. Association is not causation and does not measure the AI4WORK target group directly."
